Package: chattersyn
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: RedCyberDragon <51099384+smitht06@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/smitht06/red-chattersyn
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libegl1, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: Chatterino-style dual chat client for Twitch and YouTube
 ChatterSyn shows Twitch and YouTube live chat side by side and posts to
 both from a single input. Built on Ubuntu 22.04 (glibc 2.35); installs
 the frozen bundle to /opt/chattersyn with a /usr/bin/chattersyn launcher.
